  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"A Serilum Mod. Made with love. Lots of active mods for Fabric, Forge and Neo!\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"About the mod\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Hide Hands 是一個極簡風格的<strong>客戶端</strong>可配置模組，允許你隱藏副手和/或主手。你可以設置為始終隱藏，或者僅在持有特定物品時隱藏。預設情況下，當手持火把或不死图腾時，模組會隱藏副手；除非揮舞，否則空閒的玩家手也會被隱藏。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"Dependencies\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"Requires Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"Included in The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-client-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/client-bundle.svg\" alt=\"Included in Serilum&#x27;s Client Bundle\" width=\"359\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/client.svg\" alt=\"Environment: Client\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"Configurable\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"Configuration guide\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的配置選項：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>alwaysHideMainHand</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">如果啟用，則始終隱藏主手。如果禁用，則在持有 hideMainHandWithItems 中定義的物品時隱藏主手。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>alwaysHideEmptyMainHand</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">如果啟用，則在主手空閒時始終隱藏它。揮舞空手時仍然可見。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>hideMainHandWithItems</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 \"\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">當 alwaysHideMainHand 禁用時，手持這些物品會隱藏主手。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>alwaysHideOffhand</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">如果啟用，則始終隱藏副手。如果禁用，則在持有 hideOffhandWithItems 中定義的物品時隱藏副手。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>hideOffhandWithItems</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 \"minecraft:totem_of_undying,minecraft:torch\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">當 alwaysHideOffhand 禁用時，手持這些物品會隱藏副手。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"Showcase\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>顯示手持火把或不死图腾時隱藏副手的 GIF：</strong><br></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/hide-hands/a.webp\" alt=\"gif0\" width=\"1000\" height=\"446\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"Notes and links\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下載仍託管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內，你就可以在任何整合包中自由使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有可用模組的概覽和更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於我無法在許多單獨的模組頁面之間追蹤評論，因此評論功能已禁用。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他任何事項，請訪問&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 倉庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
